# WorkBuddy AI session state: local tooling, not project content. The memory
# directory is the exception -- it is the project's own long-term notes and the
# Chief Architect keeps this working copy as a complete mirror, so it travels
# with the repository rather than living only on one machine.
.workbuddy-ai/*
!.workbuddy-ai/memory/
